WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.070
<i>A pitiful human should 
never have been given</i>

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:07.150
<i>the right to choose Hell's 
ruler in the first place.</i>

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:11.860
<i>If we take his soul, 
the Elector himself will vanish.</i>

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:16.870
<i>And if he doesn't have his ring, 
the era of Solomon's rule will finally end.</i>

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:23.620
<i>By my name and by my 
wisdom, I command thee.</i>

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:28.790
<i>Thou shalt obey.</i>

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:29.800
<i>William!</i>

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:38.930
<i>That's the Lesser Key of Solomon!</i>

00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:43.730
<i>Has Solomon truly been resurrected?</i>

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:50.020
<i>Imagine, all of you together.
Are we having a dinner party?</i>

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.360
<i>At this rate, William will...</i>

00:00:56.770 --> 00:00:58.570
<i>If I can get this off...</i>

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.810
<i>And who are you?</i>

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:46.620
Who are you?

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.230
Please, don't interfere.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:56.400
Solomon!

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.320
Dantalion!

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.290
Dantalion!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.020
Without even batting an eye...

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:22.760
He brushed aside Dantalion, Grand 
Duke of Hell, like he was nothing.

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:24.440
No.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:29.530
Dantalion is still bound by 
his contract with Solomon.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.680
He cannot go against him.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.020
No...

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:40.440
If their contract is still in effect, 
why doesn't Solomon recognize him?

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:41.840
I don't know.

00:03:42.480 --> 00:03:49.450
But demon or not, if he suffers any 
more wounds, he may lose his life.

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:54.250
<i>You'll have more companions 
before you know it.</i>

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:56.880
<i>Oh, now I get it!</i>

00:03:57.640 --> 00:04:02.290
<i>You're summoning all these demons 
to create your own army!</i>

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:08.510
<i>Your mother was married to one 
of your father's former servants.</i>

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:13.610
<i>The guilt on his conscience after 
having laid with a servant's wife</i>

00:04:13.610 --> 00:04:17.230
<i>led him to scorn you, 
and your siblings to shun you.</i>

00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:22.200
<i>And now you want to exact 
your revenge on them</i>

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.200
<i>and bring the entire kingdom under your rule!</i>

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:30.450
<i>What's so funny?!</i>

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:32.480
<i>Revenge, huh?</i>

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:36.110
<i>That might not be bad, either.</i>

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.930
<i>Happy birthday, Solomon!</i>

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.390
<i>Thank you!</i>

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:59.760
<i>How can he be so happy-go-lucky 
with a horde of demons?!</i>

00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:02.260
<i>What's the matter, Dantalion?</i>

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:04.650
<i>Hurry up and bring over the grapes!</i>

00:05:05.810 --> 00:05:09.330
<i>Can't you be a little more 
aware of your position?!</i>

00:05:10.390 --> 00:05:11.330
<i>Position?</i>

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:14.470
<i>Aren't you upset that your own 
father had you imprisoned?!</i>

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:16.640
<i>You could be killed at any time!</i>

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:19.540
<i>Be angry! Be sad! Be depressed!</i>

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.630
<i>No. Too much trouble.</i>

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:25.300
<i>T-Too much trouble?!</i>

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:31.350
<i>You summon all these demons and contract 
with them, but do nothing further because...</i>

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.180
<i>Right. It's too much trouble.</i>

00:05:33.450 --> 00:05:34.430
<i>Solomon!</i>

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:36.380
<i>Coming!</i>

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:38.610
<i>Hey! Wait!</i>

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.920
<i>This is delicious. Try it, Solomon.</i>

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.480
<i>And this cake!</i>

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:46.500
<i>What was that about?</i>

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:49.840
<i>He may be a human, but the thought 
of what he could become is terrifying.</i>

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.940
<i>He controls every demon here,</i>

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:55.520
<i>and has wisdom unrivaled by
anyone on the face of the earth.</i>

00:05:55.520 --> 00:05:58.420
<i>Baalberith, Lord of the Spiders?!</i>

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:03.610
<i>Your Excellency, I never 
expected to see you here.</i>

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:08.760
<i>Nor did I have any desire to run into 
Astaroth's favorite Nephilim protégé.</i>

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.320
<b>Grrr...</b>

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:11.760
<i>Well...</i>

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:14.470
<i>What should we do now?</i>

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:19.730
<i>The idea of serving a human is deplorable,</i>

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:24.690
<i>yet even more so, there's 
something irresistible about him.</i>

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:30.820
<i>He was so strange.</i>

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:37.310
<i>His father locked him up, 
yet he wouldn't fight back.</i>

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:41.610
<i>All he did was summon demons and 
bind them to his will, one after another.</i>

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:47.840
<i>It finally took his father 
striking first to get him to act.</i>

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.680
<i>Guess there's no alternative.</i>

00:06:57.120 --> 00:07:01.690
<i>Solomon, reluctantly, took up arms.</i>

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:11.820
<i>Because he had no alternative, 
Solomon fought.</i>

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:14.440
<i>It came as naturally to him as breathing.</i>

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.440
<i>In the blink of an eye,</i>

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:19.700
<i>he had won.</i>

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:27.980
<i>Having overthrown his father, 
Solomon had no alternative</i>

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:29.860
<i>but to accede to the throne as king.</i>

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.290
<i>I promise you,</i>

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:36.760
<i>I take no joy in locking you up</i>

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:39.140
<i>in this cramped room, Father.</i>

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:44.610
<i>Won't you please acknowledge me as your son?</i>

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:47.530
<i>Even if it's only once.</i>

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:54.000
<i>Do that, and you can die respected
and revered as the previous king,</i>

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.670
<i>not an old man who was 
overthrown in a coup.</i>

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:03.490
<i>You are no son of mine, nor any man.</i>

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:05.810
<i>You are a child of sin.</i>

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.560
<i>I can see you clearly,</i>

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:15.580
<i>disgracing our kingdom by 
calling on the aid of demons!</i>

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:24.890
<i>Solomon, child of sin, someday 
you will bring ruin to this nation!</i>

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:29.640
<i>You never should have been 
born into this world!</i>

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.520
<i>Guess there's no alternative.</i>

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:04.820
<i>Dantalion.</i>

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:09.410
<i>If you've got nothing better to do, 
can you make me some tea?</i>

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.860
<i>Don't assume I have nothing to do!</i>

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:14.950
<i>You've been standing there this whole time.</i>

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:22.100
<i>I've been at your side for a long time now.</i>

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:23.950
<i>And I still have no idea...</i>

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:27.810
<i>what it is you really desire.</i>

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.260
<i>You'll find out one day.</i>

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:36.180
<i>Solomon?</i>

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:42.850
<i>I'll need you for something only you can do.</i>

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:44.950
<i>Only me?</i>

00:09:46.050 --> 00:09:47.670
<i>What is that?</i>

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:50.310
<i>To...</i>

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.180
<i>...kill me.</i>

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:08.100
<i>Thank you, Dantalion.</i>

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:18.710
It's been so long. Let's start the festivities.

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:23.100
Let us eat, drink and have lively debates!

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:27.520
<i>Why?</i>

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:33.480
<i>Why is Dantalion the only one 
Solomon doesn't recognize?</i>

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:38.570
It is a pleasure to see 
you again, King Solomon.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:42.320
It's been a long time, Baalberith.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:44.680
I'm sorry to tell you,

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:47.030
but your former kingdom 
has changed completely.

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:52.130
Did you know that even here in Hell, we are on the cusp of a revolution?

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:57.310
Your dear friend, His Highness 
Lucifer, has fallen into a slumber

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:59.840
from which he rarely awakes,

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:02.590
and we still have not found 
someone to take his place.

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:07.190
My point is, if I take your ring,

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:09.800
and with it the power God blessed you with,

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:13.360
even conquering Hell would be a trivial feat.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:14.730
Uncle!

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:17.030
I shall have...

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:19.390
that ring!

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:25.080
What's the meaning of this, Baalberith?

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:30.040
<i>This is the only chance I'll 
ever have to get the ring!</i>

00:11:42.140 --> 00:11:44.970
Baalberith, this is unacceptable.

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:49.100
If you're going to behave like that,

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:52.770
I'll be forced to punish you.

00:11:53.530 --> 00:11:59.440
<i>Not yet... Solomon's full 
power hasn't awakened yet!</i>

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.240
<i>I can still do it!</i>

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:09.250
Lady Astaroth...

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:15.790
Is Baalberith actually making 
a play for Solomon's ring?

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:19.150
He thinks Solomon in his 
current state is beatable?

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:31.270
Frankly, I don't care which 
one comes out on top.

00:12:31.470 --> 00:12:34.550
I hope they destroy one another.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:38.560
Once it's over, I'll swoop in and take it.

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:40.390
Go!

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:43.030
Whoever gets the ring wins!

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:49.020
You worms!

00:12:51.160 --> 00:12:53.230
Don't interfere!

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:56.920
Disgusting, low-class scum!

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:06.260
How about this?!

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:28.530
<i>This can't be...</i>

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:32.950
William Twining isn't capable 
of such destruction!

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:36.170
It must really be Solomon...

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.340
Filthy pests!

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.220
Now!

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:56.850
The ring repelled him?

00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:05.450
What's the meaning of this?

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:09.180
Dantalion was able to touch the ring...

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:13.390
Yet Baalberith was knocked away 
before he could lay a finger on it.

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:19.830
But why?

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:47.020
William...

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:08.180
Guess there's no alternative.

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.460
Farewell.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:15.060
Uncle!

00:15:17.050 --> 00:15:19.350
No, William...

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.310
<i>If this continues... it'll end the same way...</i>

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:27.190
<i>You are William, not Solomon!</i>

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:30.400
<i>I won't let history repeat itself!</i>

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:41.540
Dantalion!

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:52.820
Remember, William.

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:58.310
Remember who you are.

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:02.020
Who are you?

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:05.730
I am Dantalion.

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:08.950
I am...

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:13.200
You are William Twining!

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:17.910
William... Twining...

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.850
Come back,

00:16:39.070 --> 00:16:40.270
William!

00:16:46.280 --> 00:16:47.560
You're...

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:52.540
I'm...

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:06.790
This presence...

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:12.670
It can't be...

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:16.470
His Highness is awake?

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:33.120
His Highness Lucifer is...

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:43.790
Oh, it's you?

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:00.140
I understand.

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:07.560
I'll give this back to you.

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:41.810
Now that His Highness Lucifer has awakened,

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:45.290
there is no longer a need to hurry 
in choosing his replacement.

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:52.630
Is there, my lords and ladies?

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:56.150
Pity.

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:03.910
Your silver tongue does come
in handy every now and then.

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:30.100
Whatever.

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:34.470
We've got plenty of time now.

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:41.490
The results from our last exam are in!

00:19:42.260 --> 00:19:45.700
Twining's on top again. He's incredible!

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:48.110
He's the greatest genius in 
the history of the academy!

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:51.080
You're the talk of the school again, William.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:52.720
Hm?

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:57.280
Aren't you gonna brag and go, 
"Of course!" like always?

00:19:58.080 --> 00:19:58.940
Nah.

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:02.510
Hey, Isaac.

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:07.070
Twining, I've got a message from the Headmaster.

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:09.520
They've awarded you a full scholarship.

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:11.640
That's great, William!

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:13.090
Yeah...

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:16.910
What's with him?

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:19.450
He's been acting weird lately.

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:26.740
Dantalion?

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.310
I don't know any student called that.

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:32.990
Oh, but there was a demon named Dantalion!

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:38.380
A demon, huh?

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:44.800
No one remembered Dantalion, 
Sytry, or the Head Boy.

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:52.730
Young Master?

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:56.720
It's a rare sight to see you in church.

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:58.650
Yeah...

00:21:03.410 --> 00:21:04.580
What's wrong?

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:07.860
Kevin...

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:10.120
Do you think demons exist?

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.920
They do.

00:21:16.820 --> 00:21:20.250
And they are always trying to corrupt man.

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:23.090
Er, no, not demons like that.

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:29.780
Ones that are more human than humans, 
and more merciful than angels.

00:21:32.120 --> 00:21:34.450
Overconfident meatheads.

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:37.610
Brats who prefer candy to real food.

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:40.050
Heads of the class.

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:49.310
Sorry, I'm a bit out of it today!

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:58.670
<i>I must be, to be spouting such nonsense.</i>

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:01.210
<i>You are a realist!</i>

00:22:01.730 --> 00:22:03.020
<i>Snap out of it!</i>

00:22:06.820 --> 00:22:08.410
The family heirloom!

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:13.960
Take good care of this.

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:18.810
It belongs to you.

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:51.910
Welcome to my kingdom.

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:55.050
I am pleased to welcome you 
as a citizen for all eternity.
